                                                                                                                                           
 Usage: xrpl-camp certificate [OPTIONS]                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                           
 Generate a completion certificate and proof pack (--format text adds a .txt keepsake).                                                    
                                                                                                                                           
┌─ Options ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ --out            <str>  Folder to write the files into (default: this directory)                                                        │
│ --format         <str>  Certificate format: json (default) or text (also writes xrpl_camp_certificate.txt) [default: json]              │
│ --dry-run               Show what would be sealed without writing any files                                                             │
│ --help                  Show this message and exit.                                                                                     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

